              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Musa yaagorora omukono gwe aha nyanja; MUKAMA yaareeta omuyaga mwingi ogw'oburugwa-izooba ekyo kiro kyona, gwagarura enyanja enyima, amaizi gaabaganisibwamu habiri, ahagati yaayo haaba eitaka ryomire. ",
