            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamisri baabakurata; embaraasi za Faraho zoona n'ebigaari bye n'abantu be ab'aha mbaraasi baaza ahagati y'enyanja babakuratiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu itumbi ahu abarinzi abarikuhitsya omu kasheeshe batandikira, MUKAMA yaayema omu nyomyo y'omuriro n'ekicu, yaareeba eihe ry'Abanyamisri, yaabahahaaza emitima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaashayisa enziga z'ebigaari byabo, byarema eikurura; Abanyamisri nikwo kugira bati: Murekye tuhungye Abaisraeli; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA niwe arikubarwanira n'Abanyamisri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
