            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musa yaagorora omukono gwe aha nyanja; ku bwabaire nibutaagurukana, enyanja yaagaruka omu maani gaayo nk'oku eshangwa etuura; Abanyamisri omu kuhunga baabugabugana nayo; MUKAMA yaabinga Abanyamisri, baakunkumukira omuri egyo nyanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
